# =============================================================================
# source_prep/.gitignore: keeps the JHH data in this folder out of git.
#
# runs/, output/ and run_dates.csv hold unpublished JHH sequences and run
# details. Only README.md and this file are tracked. The empty runs/ and
# output/ folders are created on your computer by `bash scripts/build_env.sh`
# (and by scripts/prepare_source.py if they are missing), never by git.
# Do not edit; never force-add (git add -f) anything from here.
# =============================================================================
runs/
output/
run_dates.csv
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.fasta
*.fa
*.fas
*.fna
*.txt
*.partial
